id=wcg_f946b
name=Wide Color Gamut (Fold5)
version=v1.1.0
versionCode=110
author=Root-My-Galaxy
description=Enables framework Wide Color Gamut on Galaxy Z Fold5 (SM-F946B). Clears the persist.sys.sf.native_mode=1 kill-switch that Samsung's WindowManagerService/ColorDisplayService use to suppress WCG, defends it with a boot watchdog, and declares the android.hardware.wide_color_gamut feature. Panel + SurfaceFlinger already support Display-P3.
